      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ETERNAL WINTER (2) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 380m behind WHITNEY GIRL (22.66) in a Mix 5. Was in the money the start prior. Tough to beat if on-song. VILLAIN OF MAGIC (3) is having his first look at this circuit. Comes here after a last start 4th and beaten 2 lengths (30.94) at Angle Park. Form from his last run is proving strong. Should be in this for a long way. ELLEN ROSE (1) was among the minors three back at Q Lakeside then missed the frame the last two, but drawn box 1 this time where she has two wins. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. WHITNEY GIRL (8) will need to run right up to last start to feature again.",
